comments.message:
The `FirmwareName` must match the firmware object's base name from its object path. Each firmware object has an individual name. For example, both objects below have the same type but different names:
{
    "Name": "Yosemite5_MB_VR_SOC",
    "Type": "MP2X6XXFirmware",
    ...
},
{
    "Name": "Yosemite5_MB_VR_CPU0",
    "Type": "MP2X6XXFirmware",
    ...
}
